flowchart TD
    U["User question or follow-up"] --> UI["Streamlit dashboard and chat\nSession-local state"]
    UI --> O["Conversation orchestrator\nContext + deterministic fallback\n6 tools / 8 model calls / 1 repair"]
    O <--> L["Optional OpenAI adapter\nStructured tool calls + fixed-note IDs\nNo displayed free-form model prose"]
    O --> V["Pydantic tool dispatcher\nGDP / CPILFESL allowlist\nNo executable user code"]
    V --> D["Data service\nFull native histories; latest forces refresh"]
    D <--> C["Immutable snapshot cache\nJSON / CSV / raw / SHA-256 manifest\n6-hour TTL; preserve older snapshots"]
    D <--> F["Bounded FRED HTTP client\nMetadata + observations\nValidation / pagination / retries"]
    F <--> API["FRED API\nServer-side key"]
    C --> R["Explicit stale fallback or\nclear unavailable error"]
    F --> R
    R --> D
    D --> A["Deterministic Python economics\nCalendar lags; complete CPI quarters\nAligned YoY rates + Pearson sample"]
    A --> E["Typed evidence bundle\nExact records, periods, units, formulas\nSources, snapshots, freshness, limits"]
    E --> N["Deterministic numeric templates\nOptional fixed evidence-supported notes"]
    E --> P["Plotly named chart templates\nExact evidence rows; visible gaps"]
    N --> UI
    P --> UI
    E --> X["CSV / evidence JSON / HTML / PNG\nSession conversation Markdown\nPreserved captions + provenance"]
    P --> X
    O --> X
    X --> UI
